ses of fires and ways in which they could have been prevented.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"8986","via":"17-2111.02","match":"native","w":0.2}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.2,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E0","score":0,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"17-2111.02#11","text":"Develop training materials and conduct training sessions on fire protection.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"8992","via":"17-2111.02","match":"native","w":0.2}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.2,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E0","score":0,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"17-2111.02#12","text":"Study the relationships between ignition sources and materials to determine how fires start.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"8990","via":"17-2111.02","match":"native","w":0.066}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.066,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E0","score":0,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"17-2111.02#13","text":"Develop plans for the prevention of destruction by fire, wind, and water.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"8989","via":"17-2111.02","match":"native","w":0.333}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.333,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E0","score":0,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"17-2111.02#14","text":"Conduct research on fire retardants and the fire safety of materials and devices.","kind":"task","esco_uri":null,"sources":[{"source":"onet","ref":"8994","via":"17-2111.02","match":"native","w":0.066}],"n_sources":1,"weight":0.066,"ai":{"pct":0,"anthropic_penetration":0,"ilo_2025":null,"basis":"direct"},"robotics":{"tier":"E0","score":0,"basis":"direct"}},{"id":"17-2111.02#15","text":"environmental legislation","kind":"knowledge","esco_uri":"http://data.europa.eu/esco/skil